  {
   "id": "72b86e1fb6a1",
   "unit_id": "72b86e1fb6a1893ab3efa9f9048719438e906cc97f73f24af05216b026966e4c",
   "revision_key": "c555da232a118e1623a9f5b1a62466d4c9ceb4121965e8e998a43f76719681c1",
   "translation_file": "engine.lua",
   "translation_line": 655,
   "section": "engine/engine/dialogs/GameMenu.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Enable developer mode?\nDeveloper Mode is a special game mode used to debug and create addons.\nUsing it will #CRIMSON#invalidate#LAST# any savefiles loaded.\nWhen activated you will have access to special commands:\n- CTRL+L: bring up a lua console that lets you explore and alter all the game objects, enter arbitrary lua commands, ...\n- CTRL+A: bring up a menu to easily do many tasks (create NPCs, teleport to zones, ...)\n- CTRL+left click: teleport to the clicked location\n",
   "target": "启动开发者模式？\n开发者模式是一种特殊的游戏模式，用于调试游戏和创建游戏插件。\n启用开发者模式时，所有读取的存档都会成为#CRIMSON#作弊状态#LAST#。\n在开发者模式下，你可以使用以下几种特殊指令：\n- CTRL+L：启动Lua控制台，可以让你探索和修改游戏物件，并执行任意Lua脚本……\n- CTRL+A：启动调试菜单，可以让你方便地进行各种操作(创建NPC，传送到地图，等等…)\n- CTRL+鼠标左键：传送到点击的位置。\n",
   "source_file": "game/engines/default/engine/engine/dialogs/GameMenu.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": []
  },
